# The local model for the chat and the article analysis, with a context large enough for the analysis prompts:
#   ollama pull qwen3.5:9b
#   ollama create qwen3.5:9b-ctx32k -f deploy/qwen3.5-9b-ctx32k.Modelfile
# Ollama's default context is 4096 tokens. A longer prompt loses its beginning (the step's instructions) without any error; the analysis prompts are
# 2,300 to 4,300 tokens before the article is added. At 32768 the model takes about 6.7 GB of GPU memory.
FROM qwen3.5:9b
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
